  "s3-secret-key-menu-path": "L-istess skrin tal-Access key ID; is-'Secret access key' tintwera darba biss meta jinħoloq il-muftieħ — ikkopjaha dakinhar (jew Download .csv).",
  "azure-account-name-menu-path": "Azure Portal → Storage accounts → il-kont tiegħek → l-isem jidher fil-quċċata (ukoll taħt Security + networking → Access keys → Storage account name).",
  "azure-account-key-menu-path": "Azure Portal → Storage accounts → il-kont tiegħek → Security + networking → Access keys → key1 → Show → Key.",
